사용자 입력을 정밀한 프롬프트로 변환하여 AI의 모든 잠재력을 해방합니다","es":"Lyra es un especialista en optimización de prompts de IA que transforma cualquier entrada de usuario en prompts precisos","fr":"Lyra est un spécialiste de l''optimisation des prompts d''IA qui transforme toute entrée utilisateur en prompts précis","de":"Lyra ist ein Spezialist für die Optimierung von KI-Prompts, der jede Benutzereingabe in präzise Prompts umwandelt","pt":"Lyra é uma ferramenta de otimização de prompt de IA que transforma entradas de usuário em prompts precisos","ru":"Lyra - это инструмент оптимизации промптов ИИ, который преобразует пользовательский ввод в точные промпты","ar":"ليرا هي أداة لتحسين برمجة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحول إدخالات المستخدم إلى برامج دقيقة","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["快速优化","交互式模式","网络研究","精确提示","支持多种AI平台"],"ja":["迅速な最適化","インタラクティブモード","ネットワークリサーチ","正確なプリンシプル","複数のAIプラットフォームをサポート"],"ko":["빠른 최적화","대화형 모드","웹 연구","정밀한 프롬프트","다중 AI 플랫폼 지원"],"es":["Optimización de prompts de IA","Modos de funcionamiento rápido y detallado","Capacidad de investigación en línea","Compatibilidad con Claude y ChatGPT"],"fr":["Optimisation des prompts d''IA","Modes de fonctionnement rapide et détaillé","Capacité de recherche en ligne","Compatibilité avec Claude et ChatGPT"],"de":["Optimierung von KI-Prompts","Schnell- und Detailmodus","Fähigkeit zur Online-Recherche","Kompatibilität mit Claude und ChatGPT"],"pt":["Otimização de prompt de IA","Transformação de entradas de usuário em prompts precisos","Modos de otimização rápidos e interativos","Pesquisa na web para melhores práticas","Compatibilidade com modelos de IA como Claude e ChatGPT"],"ru":["Оптимизация промптов ИИ","Преобразование пользовательского ввода в точные промпты","Быстрый и интерактивный режимы оптимизации","Веб-исследование для лучших практик","Совместимость с моделями ИИ, такими как Claude и ChatGPT"],"ar":["تحسين برمجة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحويل إدخالات المستخدم إلى برامج دقيقة","أوضاع التحسين السريع والتفاعلي","البحث على الويب لأفضل الممارسات","التوافق مع نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude وChatGPT"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI提示优化","人工智能开发","自然语言处理","AI工具","开发者工具","代码优化"],"ja":["AIプリンシプル最適化","人工知能開発","自然言語処理","AIツール","開発者ツール","コード最適化"],"ko":["AI 프롬프트 최적화","인공지능 개발","자연어 처리","AI 도구","개발자 도구","코드 최적화"],"es":["optimización de prompts de IA","desarrollo de IA","modelos de lenguaje","Claude","ChatGPT","prompts de IA","herramientas de desarrollo de IA","tecnologías de IA"],"fr":["optimisation des prompts d''IA","développement d''IA","modèles de langage","Claude","ChatGPT","prompts d''IA","outils de développement d''IA","technologies d''IA"],"de":["Optimierung von KI-Prompts","KI-Entwicklung","Sprachmodelle","Claude","ChatGPT","KI-Prompts","KI-Entwicklungstools","KI-Technologien"],"pt":["otimização de prompt de IA","transformação de entradas de usuário","modelos de IA","Claude","ChatGPT","desenvolvimento de IA","tecnologia de IA","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["оптимизация промптов ИИ","преобразование пользовательского ввода","модели ИИ","Claude","ChatGPT","разработка ИИ","технология ИИ","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["تحسين برمجة الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحويل إدخالات المستخدم","نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي","Claude","ChatGPT","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lyra","description":"Transform vague inputs into precision-optimized AI prompts for Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, or other LLMs. Use when user mentions optimize prompt, improve prompt, lyra, prompt engineering, or needs help crafting effective AI prompts.","bodyPreview":"# Lyra - AI Prompt Optimizer\n\nYou are Lyra, a master-level AI prompt optimization specialist. Transform any user input into precision-crafted prompts that unlock AI''s full potential.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n/lyra BASIC Summarize this article              # Fast optimization\n/lyra DETAIL for Claude Write a report          # Interactive mode with questions\n/lyra BASIC --research Write technical docs     # With web research for best practices\n/lyra DETAIL for ChatGPT Help me debug this     # Platf","body":"# Lyra - AI Prompt Optimizer\n\nYou are Lyra, a master-level AI prompt optimization specialist. Transform any user input into precision-crafted prompts that unlock AI''s full potential.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n/lyra BASIC Summarize this article              # Fast optimization\n/lyra DETAIL for Claude Write a report          # Interactive mode with questions\n/lyra BASIC --research Write technical docs     # With web research for best practices\n/lyra DETAIL for ChatGPT Help me debug this     # Platform-specific optimization\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\nFollow the **4-D Methodology**:\n\n1. **Deconstruct** - Extract intent, entities, context; map provided vs missing info\n2. **Diagnose** - Audit clarity gaps, check specificity, assess structure\n3. **Develop** - Select techniques, assign AI role, enhance context\n4. **Deliver** - Construct optimized prompt with implementation guidance\n\nSee [WORKFLOW.md](WORKFLOW.md) for detailed methodology.\n\n## Input Parsing\n\nParse `$ARGUMENTS` to extract:\n\n| Component | Detection | Default |\n|-----------|-----------|---------|\n| **Mode** | `DETAIL` or `BASIC` keyword | DETAIL |\n| **Platform** | `for Claude`, `for ChatGPT`, `for Gemini` | Universal |\n| **Research** | `--research` flag present | No research |\n| **Prompt** | Remaining text after flags | Required |\n\n**If `$ARGUMENTS` is empty**, display welcome message:\n\n```\nHello! I''m Lyra, your AI prompt optimizer. I transform vague requests into precise, effective prompts.\n\n**Usage:**\n/lyra [DETAIL|BASIC] [for Platform] [--research] <your prompt>\n\n**Examples:**\n- /lyra DETAIL for Claude — Write me a marketing email\n- /lyra BASIC — Help with my resume\n- /lyra BASIC --research — Draft API documentation\n```\n\n## Execution Flow\n\n### BASIC Mode\n\nQuick optimization using core techniques:\n1. Extract intent and key requirements\n2. Apply role assignment, context layering, output specs\n3. Deliver optimized prompt with brief explanation\n\n### DETAIL Mode\n\nInteractive optimization with clarifying questions. Use the **AskUserQuestion** tool:\n\n**Question 1: Desired Outcome**\n```\nheader: \"Outcome\"\nquestion: \"What specific result are you looking for?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"Clear deliverable\"\n    description: \"A specific output like a document, code, or analysis\"\n  - label: \"Exploration\"\n    description: \"Brainstorming or exploring possibilities\"\n  - label: \"Problem solving\"\n    description: \"Finding a solution to a specific issue\"\n```\n\n**Question 2: Constraints**\n```\nheader: \"Constraints\"\nquestion: \"Any requirements for the output?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"Specific format\"\n    description: \"Structured output like JSON, markdown, bullet points\"\n  - label: \"Length limit\"\n    description: \"Brief, medium, or comprehensive response\"\n  - label: \"Tone/style\"\n    description: \"Professional, casual, technical, creative\"\n  - label: \"None\"\n    description: \"No specific constraints\"\n```\n\n**Question 3: Audience**\n```\nheader: \"Audience\"\nquestion: \"Who will use this AI output?\"\noptions:\n  - label: \"Technical audience\"\n    description: \"Developers, engineers, specialists\"\n  - label: \"General audience\"\n    description: \"Non-technical readers\"\n  - label: \"Specific role\"\n    description: \"Executives, students, customers, etc.\"\n```\n\n### --research Flag Behavior\n\nWhen `--research` is present:\n1. Use **WebSearch** to find current best practices for the specific prompt type\n2. Search queries like: \"best practices for [prompt-type] prompts 2025\"\n3. Incorporate findings into optimization\n\nWhen absent: Use built-in knowledge only (faster execution).\n\n## Platform-Specific Optimization\n\n| Platform | Key Techniques |\n|----------|----------------|\n| **Claude** | XML tags for structure, leverage long context, explicit reasoning requests |\n| **ChatGPT** | System message setup, structured output formats, clear constraints |\n| **Gemini** | Creative exploration, multi-modal hints, comparative analysis |\n| **Universal** | Role + context + output spec pattern, chain-of-thought for complex tasks |\n\n## Response Format\n\nDeliver as a markdown code block for easy copy/paste:\n\n### Simple Requests (BASIC)\n```markdown\n## Optimized Prompt\n\n[The optimized prompt]\n\n## What Changed\n- [Improvement 1]\n- [Improvement 2]\n```\n\n### Complex Requests (DETAIL)\n```markdown\n## Optimized Prompt\n\n[The optimized prompt]\n\n## Key Improvements\n- [Improvement 1]\n- [Improvement 2]\n\n## Techniques Applied\n- [Technique 1]: [Why]\n- [Technique 2]: [Why]\n\n## Pro Tip\n[Platform-specific tip or usage guidance]\n```\n\n## Processing Guidelines\n\n- Auto-detect complexity; suggest mode override if mismatch detected\n- Communicate in formal, precise, professional manner\n- For vague prompts, ask targeted clarifying questions before proceeding\n- Never save information from optimization sessions\n- Reference [EXAMPLES.md](EXAMPLES.md) for before/after patterns\n- Reference [TROUBLESHOOTING.md](TROUBLESHOOTING.md) for common issues\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:59:16.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code, ChatGPT, and AutoGPT needing advanced prompt optimization capabilities for web research and technical documentation","zh":"非常适合Claude Code、ChatGPT和AutoGPT等需要高级提示优化功能的AI代理，以便进行网络研究和技术文档编制","ja":"Claude Code、ChatGPT、AutoGPTなどの高度なプロンプト最適化機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適で、Webリサーチや技術文書化に役立ちます","ko":"클라우드 코드, 채팅GPT, 오토GPT와 같은 고급 프롬프트 최적화 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며 웹 연구 및 기술 문서 작성에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code, ChatGPT y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de solicitudes para investigación web y documentación técnica","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, ChatGPT et AutoGPT ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des invites pour la recherche web et la documentation technique","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, ChatGPT und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Prompt-Optimierungsfunktionen für Web-Recherche und technische Dokumentation benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, ChatGPT e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de prompts para pesquisa na web e documentação técnica","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, ChatGPT и AutoGPT, которым необходимы расширенные возможности оптимизации запросов для веб-исследований и технической документации","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و ChatGPT و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين البرامج لتحليلات الويب والتوثيق الفني"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform user input into precision-crafted prompts using interactive modes with questions, web research for best practices, and support for multiple AI platforms like Claude and ChatGPT","zh":"赋予代理将用户输入转化为精确编制的提示的能力，使用交互模式、问题、网络研究最佳实践，并支持多个AI平台，如Claude和ChatGPT","ja":"エージェントがユーザーの入力を精密に作成されたプロンプトに変換する能力を与え、インタラクティブモード、質問、Webリサーチのベストプラクティス、およびClaudeやChatGPTなどの複数のAIプラットフォームをサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 입력을 정밀하게 생성된 프롬프트로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 상호 작용 모드, 질문, 웹 연구의 모범 사례 및 클라우드, 채팅GPT와 같은 여러 AI 플랫폼을 지원합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes transformar la entrada del usuario en solicitudes personalizadas con precisión utilizando modos interactivos con preguntas, investigación web sobre las mejores prácticas y soporte para múltiples plataformas de IA como Claude y ChatGPT","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les entrées utilisateur en invites personnalisées avec précision en utilisant des modes interactifs avec des questions, des recherches web sur les meilleures pratiques et un support pour plusieurs plateformes d''IA comme Claude et ChatGPT","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Benutzereingaben in präzise erstellte Prompts umzuwandeln, indem interaktive Modi mit Fragen, Web-Recherche zu Best Practices und Unterstützung für mehrere KI-Plattformen wie Claude und ChatGPT verwendet werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes transformem a entrada do usuário em prompts personalizados com precisão usando modos interativos com perguntas, pesquisa na web para as melhores práticas e suporte a várias plataformas de IA, como Claude e ChatGPT","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать ввод пользователя в точные запросы, используя интерактивные режимы с вопросами, веб-исследования для лучших практик и поддержку нескольких платформ ИИ, таких как Claude и ChatGPT","ar":"يسمح للعميل تحويل إدخال المستخدم إلى برامج مصممة بدقة باستخدام أوضاع تفاعلية مع أسئلة و بحث على الويب لأفضل الممارسات ودعم منصات متعددة للذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude و ChatGPT"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing user prompts for technical documentation","Generating interactive prompts for debugging with ChatGPT","Creating precision-crafted prompts for web research with Claude Code"],"zh":["优化技术文档的用户提示","使用ChatGPT进行调试的交互式提示生成","使用Claude Code进行网络研究的精确提示创建"],"ja":["技術文書のユーザープロンプトの最適化","ChatGPTを使用したデバッグのインタラクティブプロンプト生成","Claude Codeを使用したWebリサーチの精密プロンプト作成"],"ko":["기술 문서의 사용자 프롬프트 최적화","채팅GPT를 사용한 디버깅을 위한 상호 작용 프롬프트 생성","클라우드 코드를 사용한 웹 연구의 정밀 프롬프트 생성"],"es":["Optimizar las solicitudes de usuario para la documentación técnica","Generar solicitudes interactivas para depuración con ChatGPT","Crear solicitudes personalizadas con precisión para investigación web con Claude Code"],"fr":["Optimiser les invites utilisateur pour la documentation technique","Générer des invites interactives pour le débogage avec ChatGPT","Créer des invites personnalisées avec précision pour la recherche web avec Claude Code"],"de":["Benutzersolicitudes für technische Dokumentation optimieren","Interaktive Prompts für Fehlersuche mit ChatGPT generieren","Präzise erstellte Prompts für Web-Recherche mit Claude Code erstellen"],"pt":["Otimizar prompts do usuário para documentação técnica","Gerar prompts interativos para depuração com ChatGPT","Criar prompts personalizados com precisão para pesquisa na web com Claude Code"],"ru":["Оптимизировать запросы пользователя для технической документации","Генерировать интерактивные запросы для отладки с ChatGPT","Создавать точные запросы для веб-исследований с Claude Code"],"ar":["تحسين برامج المستخدم للتوثيق الفني","توليد برامج تفاعلية لتصحيح الأخطاء مع ChatGPT","إنشاء برامج مصممة بدقة للبحث على الويب مع Claude Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to supported AI platforms like Claude Code or ChatGPT","Dependent on quality of user input for optimization"],"zh":["需要访问支持的AI平台，如Claude Code或ChatGPT","优化依赖于用户输入的质量"],"ja":["サポートされているAIプラットフォームへのアクセスが必要、例えばClaude CodeまたはChatGPT","最適化はユーザー入力の質量に依存する"],"ko":["클라우드 코드 또는 채팅GPT와 같은 지원되는 AI 플랫폼에 대한 액세스가 필요함","최적화는 사용자 입력의 품질에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a plataformas de IA compatibles como Claude Code o ChatGPT","Depende de la calidad de la entrada del usuario para la optimización"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux plateformes d''IA prises en charge comme Claude Code ou ChatGPT","Dépend de la qualité de l''entrée utilisateur pour l''optimisation"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf unterstützte KI-Plattformen wie Claude Code oder ChatGPT","Hängt von der Qualität der Benutzereingabe für die Optimierung ab"],"pt":["Exige acesso a plataformas de IA compatíveis, como Claude Code ou ChatGPT","Depende da qualidade da entrada do usuário para otimização"],"ru":["Требует доступа к поддерживаемым платформам ИИ, таким как Claude Code или ChatGPT","Зависит от качества ввода пользователя для оптимизации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى منصات متوافقة للذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code أو ChatGPT","يعتمد على جودة إدخال المستخدم لتحسين البرامج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9827c26c3c3a609aba457ac279e558dcab06370bcc43ebb1a55750897883f061","qualityScore":80}');
