es","Compatibilité avec la norme SKILL.md","Création de compétences avec des modèles d''activation","Structure de contenu personnalisable","Prise en charge de fichiers et de modèles supplémentaires"],"de":["Anleitung zur Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit dem SKILL.md-Standard","Erstellung von Fähigkeiten mit Aktivierungsmustern","Anpassbare Inhaltsstruktur","Unterstützung für zusätzliche Dateien und Vorlagen"],"pt":["Criação de habilidades personalizadas","Padrão SKILL.md","Guia de início rápido","Estrutura de conteúdo personalizável","Arquivos de suporte"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных навыков","Стандарт SKILL.md","Быстрый старт","Настраиваемая структура контента","Файлы поддержки"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات مخصصة","معيار SKILL.md","دليل البداية السريعة","هيكل المحتوى القابل للتخصيص","ملفات الدعم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agent Zero","创建技能","SKILL.md","开发者工具","技能创建向导","快速创建新技能"],"ja":["エージェントゼロ","スキル作成","SKILL.md","開発者ツール","スキル作成ウィザード","新しいスキルを作成"],"ko":["에이전트 제로","스킬 생성","SKILL.md","개발자 도구","스킬 생성 마법사","新的 스킬 생성"],"es":["create-skill","Agent Zero","habilidades personalizadas","SKILL.md","patrones de activación","estructura de contenido","archivos y plantillas"],"fr":["create-skill","Agent Zero","compétences personnalisées","SKILL.md","modèles d''activation","structure de contenu","fichiers et modèles"],"de":["create-skill","Agent Zero","benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten","SKILL.md","Aktivierungsmuster","Inhaltsstruktur","Dateien und Vorlagen"],"pt":["Create Skill Wizard","Agente Zero","SKILL.md","habilidades personalizadas","desenvolvimento de habilidades","Agent Zero"],"ru":["Create Skill Wizard","Agent Zero","SKILL.md","индивидуальные навыки","разработка навыков","Agent Zero"],"ar":["Create Skill Wizard","الوكيل صفر","SKILL.md","مهارات مخصصة","تطوير المهارات","الوكيل صفر"]}},"owner":"glennguilloux","repo":"Agent0","repoPath":"glennguilloux/Agent0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:14:36.620Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-skill","description":"Wizard for creating new Agent Zero skills. Guides users through creating well-structured SKILL.md files. Use when users want to create custom skills.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["meta","wizard","creation","tutorial","skills"],"bodyPreview":"# Create Skill Wizard\n\nThis skill helps you create new Agent Zero skills that follow the SKILL.md standard.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo create a new skill, I''ll guide you through these steps:\n\n1. **Name & Purpose** - What should this skill do?\n2. **Trigger Patterns** - When should this skill activate?\n3. **Content Structure** - What instructions should the agent follow?\n4. **Supporting Files** - Any scripts or templates needed?\n\n## SKILL.md Format\n\nEvery skill needs a `SKILL.md` file with YAML frontmatt","body":"# Create Skill Wizard\n\nThis skill helps you create new Agent Zero skills that follow the SKILL.md standard.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo create a new skill, I''ll guide you through these steps:\n\n1. **Name & Purpose** - What should this skill do?\n2. **Trigger Patterns** - When should this skill activate?\n3. **Content Structure** - What instructions should the agent follow?\n4. **Supporting Files** - Any scripts or templates needed?\n\n## SKILL.md Format\n\nEvery skill needs a `SKILL.md` file with YAML frontmatter:\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: \"skill-name\"\ndescription: \"Clear description of what this skill does and when to use it\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nauthor: \"Your Name\"\ntags: [\"category1\", \"category2\"]\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"keyword1\"\n  - \"phrase that triggers this\"\n---\n\n# Skill Title\n\nYour skill instructions go here...\n```\n\n## Required Fields\n\n| Field | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `name` | Unique identifier (lowercase, hyphens) | `\"code-review\"` |\n| `description` | When/why to use this skill | `\"Review code for quality and security issues\"` |\n\n## Optional Fields\n\n| Field | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `version` | Semantic version | `\"1.0.0\"` |\n| `author` | Creator name | `\"Jane Developer\"` |\n| `tags` | Categorization keywords | `[\"review\", \"quality\"]` |\n| `trigger_patterns` | Words/phrases that activate skill | `[\"review\", \"check code\"]` |\n| `allowed_tools` | Tools this skill can use | `[\"code_execution\", \"web_search\"]` |\n\n## Skill Directory Structure\n\n```\n/a0/usr/skills/\n└── my-skill/\n   ├── SKILL.md           # Required: Main skill file\n   ├── scripts/           # Optional: Helper scripts\n   │   ├── helper.py\n   │   └── process.sh\n   ├── templates/         # Optional: Templates\n   │   └── output.md\n   └── docs/              # Optional: Additional docs\n      └── examples.md\n```\n\n## Writing Good Skill Instructions\n\n### Be Specific and Actionable\n\n```markdown\n# Good\nWhen reviewing code:\n1. Check for security vulnerabilities\n2. Verify error handling\n3. Assess test coverage\n\n# Bad\nReview the code and make it better.\n```\n\n### Include Examples\n\n```markdown\n## Example Usage\n\n**User**: \"Review my Python function for issues\"\n\n**Agent Response**:\n> I''ll review your function using the code review checklist:\n>\n> 1. **Security**: No user input validation detected\n> 2. **Error Handling**: Missing try-catch for file operations\n> 3. **Testing**: Function is testable but no tests found\n```\n\n### Provide Checklists\n\n```markdown\n## Review Checklist\n- [ ] Input validation present\n- [ ] Error handling complete\n- [ ] Tests included\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n## Creating Your Skill: Step by Step\n\n### Step 1: Define Purpose\n\nAnswer these questions:\n- What problem does this skill solve?\n- When should the agent use it?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### Step 2: Choose a Name\n\n- Use lowercase letters and hyphens\n- Be descriptive but concise\n- Examples: `code-review`, `data-analysis`, `deploy-helper`\n\n### Step 3: Write Trigger Patterns\n\nList words/phrases that should activate this skill:\n\n```yaml\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"review\"\n  - \"check code\"\n  - \"code quality\"\n  - \"pull request\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Structure Your Content\n\nOrganize with clear sections:\n\n```markdown\n# Skill Title\n\n## When to Use\nDescribe the trigger conditions\n\n## The Process\nStep-by-step instructions\n\n## Examples\nShow sample interactions\n\n## Tips\nAdditional guidance\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Supporting Files (Optional)\n\nIf your skill needs scripts or templates:\n\n```bash\n# Create directory structure\nmkdir -p /a0/usr/skills/my-skill/{scripts,templates,docs}\n```\n\n## Example: Complete Skill\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: \"python-optimizer\"\ndescription: \"Optimize Python code for performance and readability. Use when asked to improve or optimize Python code.\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nauthor: \"Agent Zero Team\"\ntags: [\"python\", \"optimization\", \"performance\"]\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"optimize python\"\n  - \"improve performance\"\n  - \"make faster\"\n  - \"python optimization\"\n---\n\n# Python Optimizer\n\n## When to Use\nActivate when user asks to optimize, improve, or speed up Python code.\n\n## Optimization Process\n\n### Step 1: Profile First\nBefore optimizing, understand where time is spent:\n```python\nimport cProfile\ncProfile.run(''your_function()'')\n```\n\n### Step 2: Common Optimizations\n\n1. **Use List Comprehensions**\n   ```python\n   # Slow\n   result = []\n   for x in data:\n       result.append(x * 2)\n\n   # Fast\n   result = [x * 2 for x in data]\n   ```\n\n2. **Use Sets for Lookups**\n   ```python\n   # Slow: O(n)\n   if item in large_list:\n\n   # Fast: O(1)\n   if item in large_set:\n   ```\n\n3. **Use Generators for Large Data**\n   ```python\n   # Memory-heavy\n   data = [process(x) for x in huge_list]\n\n   # Memory-efficient\n   data = (process(x) for x in huge_list)\n   ```\n\n### Step 3: Verify Improvement\nAlways measure before and after:\n```python\nimport time\nstart = time.perf_counter()\n# code to measure\nelapsed = time.perf_counter() - start\nprint(f\"Took {elapsed:.4f} seconds\")\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n- Premature optimization\n- Optimizing without profiling\n- Sacrificing readability for tiny gains\n```\n\n## Skill Installation\n\n### Local Installation\n\n1. Create skill directory:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p /a0/usr/skills/my-skill\n   ```\n\n2. Create SKILL.md:\n   ```bash\n   touch /a0/usr/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md\n   ```\n\n3. Add content and save\n\n4. Skills are automatically loaded on next agent initialization\n\n### Sharing Skills\n\nTo share skills with others:\n\n1. Create a GitHub repository\n2. Include the skill directory structure\n3. Add a README with installation instructions\n4. Users can copy to their `/a0/usr/skills/` directory\n\n## Testing Your Skill\n\nAfter creating a skill:\n\n1. Start a new conversation\n2. Use one of your trigger patterns\n3. Verify the agent follows your instructions\n4. Iterate and improve based on results"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:02:07.784Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Agent Developers needing to create custom skills following the SKILL.md standard.","zh":"非常适合需要创建自定义技能的代理开发人员，且技能遵循SKILL.md标准。","ja":"SKILL.md標準に従ったカスタムスキルの作成が必要なエージェント開発者に最適です。","ko":"SKILL.md 표준을 따라 사용자 지정 스킬을 생성해야 하는 에이전트 개발자를 위한 완벽한 솔루션입니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de agentes que necesitan crear habilidades personalizadas siguiendo el estándar SKILL.md.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs d''agents ayant besoin de créer des compétences personnalisées suivant la norme SKILL.md.","de":"Perfekt für Agent-Entwickler, die benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten nach dem SKILL.md-Standard erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Desenvolvedores de Agentes que precisam criar habilidades personalizadas seguindo o padrão SKILL.md.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков агентов, которым необходимо создавать пользовательские навыки, соответствующие стандарту SKILL.md.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مهارات مخصصة متوافقة مع معيار SKILL.md."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate new skills with structured content using YAML frontmatter, enabling seamless integration with trigger patterns and supporting files like scripts and templates.","zh":"使代理能够使用YAML前置内容生成具有结构化内容的新技能，实现触发器模式和支持文件（如脚本和模板）之间的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがYAMLフロントマターを使用して構造化されたコンテンツを持つ新しいスキルを生成できるようにし、トリガーパターンやスクリプト、テンプレートなどのサポートファイルとのシームレスな統合を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 YAML 프론트매터를 사용하여 구조화된 콘텐츠를 갖는 새로운 스킬을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 트리거 패턴 및 스크립트, 템플릿 등의 지원 파일과 무장해적 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar nuevas habilidades con contenido estructurado utilizando frontmatter YAML, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con patrones de activación y archivos de soporte como scripts y plantillas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer de nouvelles compétences avec un contenu structuré en utilisant le frontmatter YAML, ce qui permet une intégration sans heurts avec les modèles de déclenchement et les fichiers de support tels que les scripts et les modèles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Fähigkeiten mit strukturiertem Inhalt zu generieren, indem YAML-Frontmatter verwendet wird, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Triggermustern und Supportdateien wie Skripten und Vorlagen ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar novas habilidades com conteúdo estruturado usando frontmatter YAML, permitindo integração perfeita com padrões de gatilho e arquivos de suporte como scripts e modelos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать новые навыки со структурированным содержимым, используя YAML-заголовок, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с шаблонами триггеров и вспомогательными файлами, такими как скрипты и шаблоны.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مهارات جديدة بمحتوى منظم باستخدام YAML.frontmatter ، وتمكين التكامل السلس مع أنماط الزناد والملفات الداعمة مثل البرامج النصية والقوالب."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating reusable skill templates","Defining custom trigger patterns for skill activation","Developing skills with accompanying scripts and templates"],"zh":["创建可重用的技能模板","定义自定义触发器模式以激活技能","开发具有脚本和模板的技能"],"ja":["再利用可能なスキルテンプレートを作成する","スキルを活性化するためのカスタムトリガーパターンを定義する","スクリプトやテンプレートを伴うスキルを開発する"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 스킬 템플릿을 생성한다","스킬 활성화에 대한 사용자 정의 트리거 패턴을 정의한다","스크립트 및 템플릿을 포함한 스킬을 개발한다"],"es":["Creación de plantillas de habilidades reutilizables","Definición de patrones de activación personalizados para la activación de habilidades","Desarrollo de habilidades con scripts y plantillas de acompañamiento"],"fr":["Création de modèles de compétences réutilisables","Définition de modèles de déclenchement personnalisés pour l''activation des compétences","Développement de compétences avec des scripts et des modèles d''accompagnement"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Fähigkeitsschablonen","Definition benutzerdefinierter Triggermuster für die Aktivierung von Fähigkeiten","Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten mit begleitenden Skripten und Vorlagen"],"pt":["Criação de modelos de habilidades reutilizáveis","Definição de padrões de gatilho personalizados para ativação de habilidades","Desenvolvimento de habilidades com scripts e modelos de acompanhamento"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых шаблонов навыков","Определение пользовательских шаблонов триггеров для активации навыков","Разработка навыков с сопровождающими скриптами и шаблонами"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب مهارات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تحديد أنماط زناد مخصصة لتنشيط المهارات","تطوير المهارات مع البرامج النصية والقوالب المرافقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to SKILL.md format","Needs YAML frontmatter for skill configuration"],"zh":["需要遵循SKILL.md格式","需要YAML前置内容进行技能配置"],"ja":["SKILL.md形式に従う必要がある","スキル設定にはYAMLフロントマターが必要"],"ko":["SKILL.md 형식을 따라야 한다","스킬 설정을 위해 YAML 프론트매터가 필요하다"],"es":["Requiere adherencia al formato SKILL.md","Necesita frontmatter YAML para la configuración de habilidades"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect du format SKILL.md","Nécessite un frontmatter YAML pour la configuration des compétences"],"de":["Benötigt die Einhaltung des SKILL.md-Formats","Benötigt YAML-Frontmatter für die Fähigkeitskonfiguration"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao formato SKILL.md","Necessita de frontmatter YAML para configuração de habilidades"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения формата SKILL.md","Требует YAML-заголовка для конфигурации навыков"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بنموذج SKILL.md","يحتاج إلى YAML.frontmatter لتهيئة المهارات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"55f81fc1d57546548d400d6e71470643bc64fc7bbe464ebf40609712bb43bc0c","qualityScore":80}');
