través de la línea de comandos","Activa cambios de código automatizados basados en instrucciones de lenguaje natural","Utiliza el comando gh agent-task para crear y gestionar sesiones de agente","Integra con GitHub Copilot para automatizar tareas de desarrollo","Permite la creación de sesiones de agente personalizadas para proyectos específicos"],"fr":["Crée des sessions d''agent GitHub Copilot via la ligne de commande","Déclenche des modifications de code automatisées basées sur des instructions de langage naturel","Utilise la commande gh agent-task pour créer et gérer des sessions d''agent","Intègre avec GitHub Copilot pour automatiser des tâches de développement","Permet la création de sessions d''agent personnalisées pour des projets spécifiques"],"de":["Erstellt GitHub Copilot-Agent-Sitzungen über die Kommandozeile","Löst automatisierte Codeänderungen basierend auf natürlichen Sprachanweisungen aus","Verwendet den Befehl gh agent-task zum Erstellen und Verwalten von Agentensitzungen","Integriert mit GitHub Copilot zur Automatisierung von Entwicklungsaufgaben","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Agentensitzungen für spezifische Projekte"],"pt":["Criação de sessões de agente para alterações de código automatizadas","Uso de instruções de linguagem natural para alterações de código","Integração com o GitHub Copilot","Suporte à linha de comando","Criação de issues especializadas no GitHub"],"ru":["Создание сессий агента для автоматических изменений кода","Использование инструкций естественного языка для изменений кода","Интеграция с GitHub Copilot","Поддержка командной строки","Создание специализированных issues в GitHub"],"ar":["إنشاء جلسات وكلاء لتعديلات الكود الآلية","استخدام تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية لتعديلات الكود","التكامل مع جيت هاب كوبيلوت","دعم سطر الأوامر","إنشاء قضايا متخصصة في جيت هاب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub Copilot","代理会话","自动代码更改","自然语言指令","命令行","开发效率","GitHub 扩展"],"ja":["GitHub Copilot","エージェントセッション","自動コード変更","自然言語指令","コマンドライン","開発効率","GitHub 拡張"],"ko":["GitHub Copilot","에이전트 세션","자동 코드 변경","자연어 지시문","명령줄","개발 효율성","GitHub 확장"],"es":["GitHub CLI","agente de GitHub","sesión de agente","GitHub Copilot","cambios de código automatizados","desarrollo de software","automatización de tareas"],"fr":["GitHub CLI","agent GitHub","session d''agent","GitHub Copilot","modifications de code automatisées","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tâches"],"de":["GitHub CLI","GitHub-Agent","Agentensitzung","GitHub Copilot","automatisierte Codeänderungen","Softwareentwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["GitHub CLI","Sessão de agente","Alterações de código automatizadas","Linguagem natural","GitHub Copilot","Desenvolvimento de software","Automatização de código","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["GitHub CLI","Сессия агента","Автоматические изменения кода","Естественный язык","GitHub Copilot","Разработка программного обеспечения","Автоматизация кода","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["جيت هاب CLI","جلسة وكلاء","تعديلات الكود الآلية","اللغة الطبيعية","جيت هاب كوبيلوت","تطوير البرمجيات","آلية الكود","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gh-agent-session","description":"GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension","bodyPreview":"# GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension\n\nThe `gh agent-task` CLI extension enables creating GitHub Copilot agent sessions through the command line. An agent session is a specialized GitHub issue that triggers GitHub Copilot to perform automated code changes based on natural language instructions.\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/github/agent-task (internal GitHub extension)\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent sessions are GitHub issues that:\n- Contain natural language instructions for code changes\n- Trigger Git","body":"# GitHub CLI Agent Session Extension\n\nThe `gh agent-task` CLI extension enables creating GitHub Copilot agent sessions through the command line. An agent session is a specialized GitHub issue that triggers GitHub Copilot to perform automated code changes based on natural language instructions.\n\n**Repository**: https://github.com/github/agent-task (internal GitHub extension)\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent sessions are GitHub issues that:\n- Contain natural language instructions for code changes\n- Trigger GitHub Copilot to autonomously execute the task\n- Create pull requests with the implemented changes\n- Provide a workflow for reviewing and merging automated code modifications\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall via GitHub CLI:\n\n```bash\ngh extension install github/agent-task\n```\n\n**Note**: This extension requires authentication with a Personal Access Token (PAT) that has appropriate permissions for creating issues and pull requests.\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Create Agent Task\n\nCreate a new agent session from a description:\n\n```bash\n# Create task with inline description\ngh agent-task create \"Fix the bug in authentication flow\"\n\n# Create task from file\ngh agent-task create --from-file task-description.md\n\n# Specify base branch\ngh agent-task create --base develop \"Implement new feature\"\n\n# Create in different repository\ngh agent-task create --repo owner/repo \"Update documentation\"\n```\n\n**Command Parameters:**\n- **Description** (positional): Natural language description of the task\n- **`--from-file <path>`**: Read task description from file\n- **`--base <branch>`**: Base branch for the pull request (default: repository default branch)\n- **`--repo <owner/repo>`**: Target repository (default: current repository)\n\n**Output Format:**\nThe command outputs the URL of the created agent session:\n```\nhttps://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\n```\n\n### List Agent Tasks\n\nList agent sessions in a repository:\n\n```bash\n# List all agent sessions\ngh agent-task list\n\n# List with filters\ngh agent-task list --state open\ngh agent-task list --state closed\ngh agent-task list --state all\n```\n\n### View Agent Task\n\nView details of a specific agent session:\n\n```bash\n# View by number\ngh agent-task view 123\n\n# View by URL\ngh agent-task view https://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\n```\n\n### Update Agent Task\n\nUpdate an existing agent session:\n\n```bash\n# Update description\ngh agent-task update 123 \"Updated task description\"\n\n# Update from file\ngh agent-task update 123 --from-file updated-description.md\n```\n\n## Task Description Format\n\nAgent session descriptions should be clear, specific natural language instructions:\n\n**Good Example:**\n```markdown\n# Refactor User Authentication\n\nRefactor the user authentication flow in `src/auth/login.js` to:\n1. Use async/await instead of callbacks\n2. Add proper error handling with specific error messages\n3. Add input validation for email format\n4. Update tests to cover the new implementation\n\nMaintain backward compatibility with the existing API.\n```\n\n**Poor Example:**\n```markdown\nFix auth\n```\n\n**Best Practices:**\n- Be specific about what needs to change\n- Reference file paths when relevant\n- Include acceptance criteria\n- Specify any constraints or requirements\n- Mention testing expectations\n\n## Integration with GitHub Agentic Workflows\n\nThe `gh agent-task` extension is used by the `create-agent-session` safe output feature in GitHub Agentic Workflows (gh-aw).\n\n### Safe Output Configuration\n\n```yaml\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: main                       # Base branch for agent session PR\n    target-repo: \"owner/target-repo\" # Cross-repository task creation\n```\n\n### Workflow Example\n\n```yaml\non:\n  issues:\n    types: [labeled]\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  actions: read\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: main\n\n# Code Task Delegator\n\nWhen an issue is labeled with \"code-task\", analyze the requirements and create a GitHub Copilot agent session with detailed instructions for implementing the requested changes.\n```\n\n### Implementation Details\n\nThe safe output processor:\n1. Reads agent output from the workflow execution\n2. Extracts `create_agent_task` items from the structured output\n3. Writes task descriptions to temporary files\n4. Executes `gh agent-task create --from-file <file> --base <branch>`\n5. Captures the created task URL and number\n6. Reports results in job summary\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- `GITHUB_AW_AGENT_TASK_BASE`: Base branch for the pull request\n- `GITHUB_AW_TARGET_REPO`: Target repository for cross-repo task creation\n- `GITHUB_AW_SAFE_OUTPUTS_STAGED`: Preview mode flag\n\n## Authentication Requirements\n\nAgent session creation requires elevated permissions beyond the default `GITHUB_TOKEN`:\n\n**Required Permissions:**\n- `contents: write` - To create branches and commits\n- `issues: write` - To create the agent session issue\n- `pull-requests: write` - To create pull requests\n\n**Token Precedence:**\n1. `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` - Dedicated Copilot operations token (recommended)\n2. `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` - General override token (legacy)\n3. Custom token via `github-token` configuration field\n\n**Note**: The default `GITHUB_TOKEN` is **not** supported as it lacks required permissions. The `COPILOT_CLI_TOKEN` and `GH_AW_COPILOT_TOKEN` secrets are no longer supported as of v0.26+.\n\n### Setting Up Authentication\n\nStore your Personal Access Token in repository secrets:\n\n```bash\n# In your repository settings, add secret:\n# Name: COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN (recommended)\n# Value: ghp_YourPersonalAccessToken\n```\n\n:::note[Backward Compatibility]\nLegacy token name `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` is still supported for backward compatibility. The `GH_AW_COPILOT_TOKEN` token is no longer supported as of v0.26+.\n:::\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Authentication Errors\n\n```\nError: failed to create agent session\nauthentication required\n```\n\n**Solution**: Configure `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` or legacy `GH_AW_GITHUB_TOKEN` with a PAT.\n\n### Permission Errors\n\n```\nError: 403 Forbidden\nResource not accessible by integration\n```\n\n**Solution**: Ensure the token has `contents: write`, `issues: write`, and `pull-requests: write` permissions.\n\n### Repository Not Found\n\n```\nError: repository not found\n```\n\n**Solution**: Verify the target repository exists and the token has access to it.\n\n## Testing in Staged Mode\n\nWhen `safe-outputs.staged: true`, agent sessions are previewed without creation:\n\n```yaml\nsafe-outputs:\n  staged: true\n  create-agent-session:\n```\n\n**Staged Output:**\n```markdown\n## 🎭 Staged Mode: Create Agent Tasks Preview\n\nThe following agent sessions would be created if staged mode was disabled:\n\n### Task 1\n\n**Description:**\nRefactor authentication to use async/await pattern\n\n**Base Branch:** main\n\n**Target Repository:** owner/repo\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Issue-Triggered Agent Tasks\n\n```yaml\non:\n  issues:\n    types: [labeled]\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n\nWhen issue is labeled with \"needs-implementation\", create an agent session with implementation instructions.\n```\n\n### Scheduled Code Improvements\n\n```yaml\non:\n  schedule:\n    - cron: \"0 9 * * 1\"  # Monday 9AM\nengine: copilot\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    base: develop\n\nAnalyze codebase for improvement opportunities and create agent sessions for top 3 improvements.\n```\n\n### Cross-Repository Task Delegation\n\n```yaml\non: workflow_dispatch\nengine: claude\nsafe-outputs:\n  create-agent-session:\n    target-repo: \"organization/backend-repo\"\n    base: main\n\nCreate agent session in backend repository to implement the API changes described in this issue.\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Task Description Guidelines\n\n1. **Be Specific**: Include file paths, function names, and exact requirements\n2. **Include Context**: Explain why the change is needed\n3. **Define Success**: Specify acceptance criteria or expected outcomes\n4. **Mention Tests**: Request test coverage for changes\n5. **Set Constraints**: Note any compatibility requirements or limitations\n\n### Security Considerations\n\n1. **Token Security**: Store PATs as secrets, never commit to repository\n2. **Permission Scope**: Use minimum required permissions on tokens\n3. **Repository Access**: Validate target repository before task creation\n4. **Review Process**: Establish review workflow for agent-generated code\n\n### Operational Guidelines\n\n1. **Monitor Usage**: Track agent session creation and completion rates\n2. **Review Output**: Always review agent-generated pull requests\n3. **Iterate**: Refine task descriptions based on agent performance\n4. **Document**: Maintain patterns for common task types\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Task Creation Fails Silently\n\n**Symptom**: No error but no task created\n\n**Check**:\n1. Verify `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` is set in repository secrets\n2. Confirm token has required permissions\n3. Check job logs for error messages\n4. Verify target repository exists and is accessible\n\n### Agent Task Not Triggering Copilot\n\n**Symptom**: Task created but no automated PR\n\n**Possible Causes**:\n1. GitHub Copilot not enabled for repository\n2. Task description unclear or ambiguous\n3. Repository settings blocking automated PRs\n4. Copilot service issues\n\n**Solution**: Check repository Copilot settings and refine task description.\n\n### Cross-Repository Tasks Fail\n\n**Symptom**: Error when creating tasks in different repository\n\n**Check**:\n1. Token has access to target repository\n2. Target repository exists and is spelled correctly\n3. Token has required permissions in target repository\n\n## Output Structure\n\nWhen used via safe outputs, the create-agent-session job provides outputs:\n\n```yaml\noutputs:\n  task_number: \"123\"\n  task_url: \"https://github.com/owner/repo/issues/123\"\n```\n\n**Usage in Dependent Jobs:**\n```yaml\njobs:\n  follow_up:\n    needs: create_agent_task\n    steps:\n      - name: Notify team\n        run: |\n          echo \"Agent session created: ${{ needs.create_agent_task.outputs.task_url }}\"\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [GitHub Copilot Documentation](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot)\n- [GitHub CLI Extensions](https://docs.github.com/en/github-cli/github-cli/using-github-cli-extensions)\n- [Safe Outputs Documentation](https://github.github.com/gh-aw/reference/safe-outputs/)\n- [Personal Access Tokens](https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/creating-a-personal-access-token)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:04:14.536Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing automated code changes through natural language instructions via GitHub Copilot","zh":"非常适合需要通过 GitHub Copilot 自动化代码更改的代码分析代理，通过自然语言指令实现","ja":"GitHub Copilot を使用して自然言語命令で自動コード変更を必要とするコード分析エージェントに最適","ko":"GitHub Copilot를 통해 자연어 지시로 자동 코드 변경이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan cambios de código automatizados a través de instrucciones de lenguaje natural mediante GitHub Copilot","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant des modifications de code automatisées via des instructions de langage naturel via GitHub Copilot","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die automatisierte Code-Änderungen durch natürliche Sprachanweisungen über GitHub Copilot benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que precisam de alterações de código automatizadas por meio de instruções de linguagem natural via GitHub Copilot","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым необходимы автоматические изменения кода через инструкции естественного языка с помощью GitHub Copilot","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تغييرات الكود الآلي من خلال تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية من خلال GitHub Copilot"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trigger automated code changes based on natural language instructions through GitHub issues, utilizing the GitHub CLI and GitHub Copilot, and supporting protocols like Git","zh":"赋予代理通过 GitHub 问题触发自动代码更改的能力，利用 GitHub CLI 和 GitHub Copilot，并支持 Git 等协议","ja":"GitHub CLI と GitHub Copilot を使用して、エージェントが GitHub の問題に基づいて自動コード変更をトリガーできるようにし、Git などのプロトコルをサポート","ko":"GitHub CLI 및 GitHub Copilot를 사용하여 에이전트가 GitHub 문제를 기반으로 자동 코드 변경을 트리거할 수 있도록 하며 Git과 같은 프로토콜을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes para desencadenar cambios de código automatizados en función de instrucciones de lenguaje natural a través de problemas de GitHub, utilizando GitHub CLI y GitHub Copilot, y admitiendo protocolos como Git","fr":"Permet aux agents de déclencher des modifications de code automatisées en fonction d''instructions de langage naturel via des problèmes GitHub, en utilisant GitHub CLI et GitHub Copilot, et en prenant en charge des protocoles comme Git","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, automatisierte Code-Änderungen auf der Grundlage natürlicher Sprachanweisungen über GitHub-Probleme auszulösen, indem GitHub CLI und GitHub Copilot verwendet und Protokolle wie Git unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acionar alterações de código automatizadas com base em instruções de linguagem natural por meio de problemas do GitHub, utilizando o GitHub CLI e o GitHub Copilot, e suportando protocolos como o Git","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать автоматические изменения кода на основе инструкций естественного языка через проблемы GitHub, используя GitHub CLI и GitHub Copilot, и поддерживая протоколы như Git","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تشغيل تغييرات الكود الآلي بناءً على تعليمات اللغة الطبيعية من خلال مشاكل GitHub ، باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub و GitHub Copilot ، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل Git"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code refactoring","Generating pull requests","Triggering GitHub Copilot actions"],"zh":["自动化代码重构","生成拉取请求","触发 GitHub Copilot 操作"],"ja":["コードのリファクタリングの自動化","プルリクエストの生成","GitHub Copilot アクションのトリガー"],"ko":["코드 리팩토링 자동화","풀 요청 생성","GitHub Copilot 동작 트리거"],"es":["Automatización de refactorización de código","Generación de solicitudes de extracción","Desencadenamiento de acciones de GitHub Copilot"],"fr":["Automatisation de la refactorisation de code","Génération de demandes d''extraction","Déclenchement d''actions GitHub Copilot"],"de":["Automatisierung der Code-Refaktorisierung","Generierung von Pull-Requests","Auslösen von GitHub Copilot-Aktionen"],"pt":["Automatização da refatoração de código","Geração de solicitações de pull","Acionamento de ações do GitHub Copilot"],"ru":["Автоматизация рефакторинга кода","Генерация запросов на слияние","Запуск действий GitHub Copilot"],"ar":["أتمتة إعادة هيكلة الكود","генерация طلبات السحب","تشغيل إجراءات GitHub Copilot"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI extension","Internal GitHub extension","Git repository access needed"],"zh":["需要 GitHub CLI 扩展","内部 GitHub 扩展","需要 Git 仓库访问"],"ja":["GitHub CLI 拡張機能が必要","内部 GitHub 拡張機能","Git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 확장 기능 필요","내부 GitHub 확장","Git 저장소 액세스 필요"],"es":["Requiere extensión de GitHub CLI","Extensión interna de GitHub","Se necesita acceso al repositorio Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''extension GitHub CLI","Extension interne GitHub","Accès au référentiel Git nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub CLI-Erweiterung","Interne GitHub-Erweiterung","Git-Repository-Zugriff erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer extensão do GitHub CLI","Extensão interna do GitHub","Acesso ao repositório Git necessário"],"ru":["Требуется расширение GitHub CLI","Внутреннее расширение GitHub","Требуется доступ к репозиторию Git"],"ar":["يتطلب امتداد واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub","امتداد داخلي لجيت هاب","يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع جيت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a25dec86f649c29a991837ecbe5ab91f5fe02323fc987ebb8aaaebbdf15484d8","qualityScore":80}');
