التحقق من описания JSDoc","المقارنة مع الكود المصدري","التحقق من الخواص في properties.ts"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API 文档审查","系统化审查","源代码比较","函数签名","类型验证","JSDoc","属性检查"],"ja":["API ドキュメントレビュー","体系的なレビュー","ソースコードとの比較","関数シグネチャ","タイプの検証","JSDoc","プロパティの確認"],"ko":["API 문서 검토","체계적인 검토","소스 코드와의 비교","함수 시그니처","타입 검증","JSDoc","속성 확인"],"es":["revisión de API","documentación de API","desarrollo de software","pruebas de API","verificación de código","JSDoc"],"fr":["révision de l''API","documentation de l''API","développement de logiciels","tests de l''API","vérification de code","JSDoc"],"de":["API-Überprüfung","API-Dokumentation","Software-Entwicklung","API-Tests","Code-Überprüfung","JSDoc"],"pt":["revisão de API","documentação de API","precisão","consistência","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","qualidade de software"],"ru":["проверка API","документация API","точность","согласованность","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","качество программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مراجعة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","وثائق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","الدقة","الاتساق","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","جودة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"repo-website-api-review","description":"Review and verify API documentation routes on the Formisch website. Use when checking documentation accuracy, completeness, and consistency with source code.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Reviewing API Documentation\n\nThis skill provides a systematic approach to reviewing API documentation routes for accuracy and consistency.\n\n## Review Process\n\n### Step 1: Compare with Source Code\n\nFor each documented API:\n\n1. **Read the source file** completely\n2. **Compare function signatures** - Must match exactly\n3. **Verify types** - Generics, parameters, return types\n4. **Check JSDoc** - Descriptions should match\n\n### Step 2: Check properties.ts\n\nVerify each property:\n\n- [ ] Generic const","body":"# Reviewing API Documentation\n\nThis skill provides a systematic approach to reviewing API documentation routes for accuracy and consistency.\n\n## Review Process\n\n### Step 1: Compare with Source Code\n\nFor each documented API:\n\n1. **Read the source file** completely\n2. **Compare function signatures** - Must match exactly\n3. **Verify types** - Generics, parameters, return types\n4. **Check JSDoc** - Descriptions should match\n\n### Step 2: Check properties.ts\n\nVerify each property:\n\n- [ ] Generic constraints match source code\n- [ ] Parameter types are accurate\n- [ ] Return type is correct\n- [ ] All `href` links are valid\n- [ ] No unused properties defined\n\n### Step 3: Check index.mdx\n\nVerify content:\n\n- [ ] Front matter is complete (title, description, source, contributors)\n- [ ] Function signature matches source exactly\n- [ ] All generics documented\n- [ ] All parameters documented with correct headings (Parameters vs Properties)\n- [ ] Explanation references specific parameters/properties\n- [ ] Examples are realistic and follow conventions\n- [ ] Related section uses correct framework terminology\n\n### Step 4: Check Menu and Links\n\n- [ ] API listed in menu.md (alphabetical order)\n- [ ] All internal links work\n- [ ] Cross-package links use absolute paths\n- [ ] No broken links to types or functions\n\n## Common Issues to Find\n\n### Signature Mismatches\n\n```typescript\n// Source code\nexport function validate(form: FormStore, config?: Config): void;\n\n// ❌ Documentation shows different signature\nconst result = validate(form); // Missing config, wrong return\n```\n\n### Missing Parameters\n\nDocumentation should include ALL parameters from source:\n\n```mdx\n## Parameters\n\n- `form` <Property {...properties.form} />\n- `config` <Property {...properties.config} /> <!-- Don''t forget optional params -->\n```\n\n### Wrong Headings\n\n| API Type   | Heading         |\n| ---------- | --------------- |\n| Functions  | `## Parameters` |\n| Components | `## Properties` |\n\n### Outdated Examples\n\nExamples must work with current API:\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Old API usage\nconst form = createForm(schema);\n\n// ✅ Current API\nconst form = createForm({ schema });\n```\n\n### Framework Terminology\n\n| Framework | Related Section Heading |\n| --------- | ----------------------- |\n| Solid     | `### Primitives`        |\n| Qwik      | `### Hooks`             |\n| Preact    | `### Hooks`             |\n| Vue       | `### Composables`       |\n| Svelte    | `### Runes`             |\n\n### Type Links\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Wrong - using constraint type name\ngenerics: [{ type: ''custom'', name: ''RequiredPath'' }];\n\n// ✅ Correct - using parameter name\ngenerics: [{ type: ''custom'', name: ''TFieldPath'' }];\n```\n\n### Cross-Package Links\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Wrong - relative across packages\nhref: ''../../../core/api/Schema/'';\n\n// ✅ Correct - absolute path\nhref: ''/core/api/Schema/'';\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n### properties.ts\n\n- [ ] All generics have `modifier: ''extends''`\n- [ ] Custom types have valid `href` links\n- [ ] Property order: `name`, `href`, `generics`\n- [ ] No unused properties\n- [ ] Types match source exactly\n\n### index.mdx\n\n- [ ] Title matches API name exactly (case-sensitive)\n- [ ] Description ends with period\n- [ ] Source path is correct\n- [ ] Function signature code block matches source\n- [ ] Correct heading (Parameters/Properties)\n- [ ] Explanation references specific params/props\n- [ ] Returns section present (unless void or component)\n- [ ] Examples section present (unless component/type)\n- [ ] Related section uses correct framework terminology\n- [ ] No Types in Related section\n\n### Menu Integration\n\n- [ ] API listed in appropriate menu.md\n- [ ] Alphabetical order maintained\n- [ ] Link path matches folder structure\n\n### Link Validation\n\n- [ ] All `href` in properties.ts resolve\n- [ ] ApiList links are valid\n- [ ] Cross-framework links use absolute paths\n- [ ] External links (Valibot) use full URLs\n\n## Review Output Format\n\nDocument issues found:\n\n```markdown\n## Review: createForm\n\n### Issues Found\n\n1. **Signature mismatch** (L15)\n   - Source shows `config: FormConfig<TSchema>`\n   - Docs show `config: Config`\n\n2. **Missing parameter** (Parameters section)\n   - `initialInput` not documented\n\n3. **Broken link** (properties.ts L23)\n   - `href: ''../FormConfig/''` - FormConfig not documented\n\n### Recommendations\n\n- Update properties.ts with correct FormConfig type\n- Add initialInput to Parameters section\n- Create FormConfig type documentation\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:09:16.418Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing precise API documentation validation and consistency checks.","zh":"适用于需要精确API文档验证和一致性检查的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが正確なAPIドキュメントの検証と一貫性のチェックを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"정확한 API 문서 검증 및 일관성 확인이 필요한 코드 검토 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una validación precisa de la documentación de API y comprobaciones de coherencia.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une validation précise de la documentation d''API et des vérifications de cohérence.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine präzise API-Dokumentationsvalidierung und Konsistenzprüfungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de validação precisa da documentação da API e verificações de consistência.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым требуется точная проверка документации API и проверки согласованности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق الدقيق من توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات والتحقق من الاتساق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically review API documentation routes for accuracy, verifying function signatures, types, and JSDoc descriptions, ensuring consistency with source code and properties defined in files like properties.ts.","zh":"使代理能够系统地审查API文档路由以确保准确性，验证函数签名、类型和JSDoc描述，确保与源代码和文件中定义的属性（如properties.ts）的一致性。","ja":"エージェントがAPIドキュメントのルートを体系的にレビューして正確性を確認することを可能にし、関数シグネチャ、タイプ、JSDocの説明を検証し、ソースコードおよびproperties.tsなどのファイルで定義されたプロパティとの一貫性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 API 문서 路由를 체계적으로 검토하여 정확성을 확인할 수 있도록 하며, 함수 시그니처, 유형 및 JSDoc 설명을 검증하고 소스 코드 및 properties.ts와 같은 파일에 정의된 속성과 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar sistemáticamente las rutas de documentación de API para garantizar la precisión, verificando firmas de función, tipos y descripciones de JSDoc, asegurando la coherencia con el código fuente y las propiedades definidas en archivos como properties.ts.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser systématiquement les routes de documentation d''API pour garantir l''exactitude, en vérifiant les signatures de fonction, les types et les descriptions JSDoc, en assurant la cohérence avec le code source et les propriétés définies dans des fichiers comme properties.ts.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die API-Dokumentationsrouten systematisch auf Genauigkeit zu überprüfen, indem sie Funktionsignaturen, Typen und JSDoc-Beschreibungen verifizieren und die Konsistenz mit dem Quellcode und den in Dateien wie properties.ts definierten Eigenschaften sicherstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar sistematicamente as rotas de documentação da API para precisão, verificando assinaturas de função, tipos e descrições do JSDoc, garantindo a consistência com o código-fonte e as propriedades definidas em arquivos como properties.ts.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически проверять документацию API на точность, проверяя сигнатуры функций, типы и описания JSDoc, обеспечивая согласованность с исходным кодом и свойствами, определёнными в файлах типа properties.ts.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على مراجعة مسارات توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات بشكل منهجي من أجل الدقة، والتحقق من التوقيعات الدالة وأنواعها ووصفات JSDoc، وضمان الاتساق مع الشفرة المصدرية والخصائص المحددة في الملفات مثل properties.ts."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating API documentation against source code","Checking properties for generic constants and consistency","Ensuring JSDoc descriptions match implementation details"],"zh":["验证API文档与源代码的一致性","检查属性以查找通用常量和一致性","确保JSDoc描述与实现细节匹配"],"ja":["ソースコードに対するAPIドキュメントの検証","汎用定数と一貫性のためのプロパティの確認","実装詳細と一致するJSDocの説明の確保"],"ko":["소스 코드에 대한 API 문서의 검증","일반 상수 및 일관성에 대한 속성 확인","구현 세부 정보와 일치하는 JSDoc 설명의 보장"],"es":["Validar la documentación de API contra el código fuente","Comprobar las propiedades para constantes genéricas y coherencia","Asegurar que las descripciones de JSDoc coincidan con los detalles de implementación"],"fr":["Valider la documentation d''API par rapport au code source","Vérifier les propriétés pour les constantes génériques et la cohérence","Assurer que les descriptions JSDoc correspondent aux détails d''implémentation"],"de":["API-Dokumentation gegen den Quellcode validieren","Eigenschaften auf generische Konstanten und Konsistenz überprüfen","Sicherstellen, dass JSDoc-Beschreibungen mit den Implementierungsdetails übereinstimmen"],"pt":["Validar a documentação da API contra o código-fonte","Verificar as propriedades para constantes genéricas e consistência","Garantir que as descrições do JSDoc correspondam aos detalhes da implementação"],"ru":["Проверка документации API против исходного кода","Проверка свойств на общие константы и согласованность","Обеспечение того, что описания JSDoc соответствуют деталям реализации"],"ar":["التحقق من توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مقابل الشفرة المصدرية","التحقق من الخصائص لثوابت عامة ومدى الاتساق","ضمان مطابقة وصفات JSDoc لتفاصيل التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to source code and API documentation","Limited to APIs with available source code for comparison","May require additional configuration for non-standard JSDoc formats"],"zh":["需要访问源代码和API文档","仅限于具有可比对源代码的API","可能需要为非标准JSDoc格式进行额外配置"],"ja":["ソースコードとAPIドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","比較可能なソースコードを持つAPIに限定される","非標準のJSDoc形式の場合、追加の設定が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["소스 코드 및 API 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요","비교 가능한 소스 코드가 있는 API로 제한","비표준 JSDoc 형식의 경우 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código fuente y a la documentación de API","Limitado a APIs con código fuente disponible para la comparación","Puede requerir configuración adicional para formatos de JSDoc no estándar"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code source et à la documentation d''API","Limité aux API avec un code source disponible pour la comparaison","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour les formats JSDoc non standard"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den Quellcode und die API-Dokumentation","Begrenzt auf APIs mit verfügbarer Quellcode für den Vergleich","Kann zusätzliche Konfiguration für nicht-standardmäßige JSDoc-Formate erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código-fonte e à documentação da API","Limitado a APIs com código-fonte disponível para comparação","Pode exigir configuração adicional para formatos JSDoc não padrão"],"ru":["Требует доступа к исходному коду и документации API","Ограничен для API с доступным исходным кодом для сравнения","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для нестандартных форматов JSDoc"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الشفرة المصدرية وتوثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","محدود لواجهات برمجة التطبيقات التي لديها شفرة مصدرية متاحة للمقارنة","قد يتطلب تكوينًا إضافيًا لأنماط JSDoc غير المعيارية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4cc6ac5b570dc2c4981a8fcd52bfb6dde39cad960ca96185655169c14ae0dd3b","qualityScore":80}');
