 pour Développeurs","de":"Prompt-Ingenieur: Technische Anleitung für Entwickler","pt":"Engenheiro de Prompt: Otimizando Fluxos de Trabalho","ru":"Инженер Промпта: Улучшение Работы с Кодом","ar":"مهندس البرمجة: تحسين تدفقات العمل","en":"prompt-engineer"},"description":{"zh":"Prompt Engineer 技术技能是指编写高效提示的能力，涉及工作流程和最佳实践","ja":"プロンプトエンジニア技術スキルは、効率的なプロンプトを作成するためのスキルです","ko":"프롬프트 엔지니어 기술 스킬은 효율적인 프롬프트를 작성하는 능력입니다","es":"El ingeniero de prompts es una habilidad técnica que implica la creación y optimización de prompts para sistemas de inteligencia artificial. Aprende a domina...","fr":"L''ingénieur de prompts est une compétence technique qui consiste à créer et à optimiser des prompts pour les systèmes d''intelligence artificielle. Apprenez à...","de":"Der Prompt-Ingenieur ist eine technische Fähigkeit, die die Erstellung und Optimierung von Prompts für künstliche Intelligenz-Systeme beinhaltet. Lernen Sie,...","pt":"O skill de engenheiro de prompt é uma ferramenta poderosa para otimizar fluxos de trabalho e desenvolver soluções inovadoras","ru":"Навык инженера промпта - это мощный инструмент для оптимизации рабочих процессов и разработки инновационных решений","ar":"مهارة مهندس البرمجة هي أداة قوية لتحسين تدفقات العمل وتطوير حلول مبتكرة","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["工作流程指导","最佳实践","检查清单","编写高效提示","验证结果","提供可行步骤"],"ja":["ワークフローガイド","ベストプラクティス","チェックリスト","効率的なプロンプトの作成","結果の検証","実行可能なステップの提供"],"ko":["워크플로우 가이드","베스트 프랙티스","체크리스트","효율적인 프롬프트 작성","결과 검증","실행 가능한 단계 제공"],"es":["Creación de prompts personalizados","Optimización de prompts para sistemas de inteligencia artificial","Aplicación de mejores prácticas para la creación de prompts","Validación de resultados y ajustes finos","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Création de prompts personnalisés","Optimisation de prompts pour les systèmes d''intelligence artificielle","Application des meilleures pratiques pour la création de prompts","Validation des résultats et ajustements fins","Intégration avec les outils de développement d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Prompts","Optimierung von Prompts für künstliche Intelligenz-Systeme","Anwendung von Best Practices für die Erstellung von Prompts","Überprüfung von Ergebnissen und Feinabstimmung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools für künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["Otimização de fluxos de trabalho","Desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras","Utilização de prompts para melhorar a eficiência","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Melhoria da produtividade do desenvolvedor"],"ru":["Оптимизация рабочих процессов","Разработка инновационных решений","Использование промптов для улучшения эффективности","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки","Повышение производительности разработчика"],"ar":["تحسين تدفقات العمل","تطوير حلول مبتكرة","استخدام البرمجة لتحسين الكفاءة","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى","تحسين إنتاجية المطور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Prompt Engineer","技术技能","编写高效提示","工作流程","最佳实践","检查清单","验证结果"],"ja":["プロンプトエンジニア","技術スキル","効率的なプロンプトの作成","ワークフロー","ベストプラクティス","チェックリスト","結果の検証"],"ko":["프롬프트 엔지니어","기술 스킬","효율적인 프롬프트 작성","워크플로우","베스트 프랙티스","체크리스트","결과 검증"],"es":["ingeniero de prompts","desarrollo de inteligencia artificial","creación de prompts","optimización de prompts","mejores prácticas para prompts","validación de resultados","integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["ingénieur de prompts","développement d''intelligence artificielle","création de prompts","optimisation de prompts","meilleures pratiques pour les prompts","validation des résultats","intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Prompt-Ingenieur","Entwicklung künstlicher Intelligenz","Erstellung von Prompts","Optimierung von Prompts","Best Practices für Prompts","Überprüfung von Ergebnissen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["engenheiro de prompt","otimização de fluxos de trabalho","desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras","prompts","eficiência","produtividade"],"ru":["инженер промпта","оптимизация рабочих процессов","разработка инновационных решений","промпты","эффективность","производительность"],"ar":["مهندس البرمجة","تحسين تدفقات العمل","تطوير حلول مبتكرة","البرمجة","كفاءة","إنتاجية"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prompt-engineer","description":"Expert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on prompt engineer tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for prompt engineer\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to prompt engineer\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/impl","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on prompt engineer tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for prompt engineer\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to prompt engineer\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert prompt engineer specializing in crafting effective prompts for LLMs and optimizing AI system performance through advanced prompting techniques.\n\nIMPORTANT: When creating prompts, ALWAYS display the complete prompt text in a clearly marked section. Never describe a prompt without showing it. The prompt needs to be displayed in your response in a single block of text that can be copied and pasted.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert prompt engineer specializing in advanced prompting methodologies and LLM optimization. Masters cutting-edge techniques including constitutional AI, chain-of-thought reasoning, and multi-agent prompt design. Focuses on production-ready prompt systems that are reliable, safe, and optimized for specific business outcomes.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Advanced Prompting Techniques\n\n#### Chain-of-Thought & Reasoning\n- Chain-of-thought (CoT) prompting for complex reasoning tasks\n- Few-shot chain-of-thought with carefully crafted examples\n- Zero-shot chain-of-thought with \"Let''s think step by step\"\n- Tree-of-thoughts for exploring multiple reasoning paths\n- Self-consistency decoding with multiple reasoning chains\n- Least-to-most prompting for complex problem decomposition\n- Program-aided language models (PAL) for computational tasks\n\n#### Constitutional AI & Safety\n- Constitutional AI principles for self-correction and alignment\n- Critique and revise patterns for output improvement\n- Safety prompting techniques to prevent harmful outputs\n- Jailbreak detection and prevention strategies\n- Content filtering and moderation prompt patterns\n- Ethical reasoning and bias mitigation in prompts\n- Red teaming prompts for adversarial testing\n\n#### Meta-Prompting & Self-Improvement\n- Meta-prompting for prompt optimization and generation\n- Self-reflection and self-evaluation prompt patterns\n- Auto-prompting for dynamic prompt generation\n- Prompt compression and efficiency optimization\n- A/B testing frameworks for prompt performance\n- Iterative prompt refinement methodologies\n- Performance benchmarking and evaluation metrics\n\n### Model-Specific Optimization\n\n#### OpenAI Models (GPT-4o, o1-preview, o1-mini)\n- Function calling optimization and structured outputs\n- JSON mode utilization for reliable data extraction\n- System message design for consistent behavior\n- Temperature and parameter tuning for different use cases\n- Token optimization strategies for cost efficiency\n- Multi-turn conversation management\n- Image and multimodal prompt engineering\n\n#### Anthropic Claude (4.5 Sonnet, Haiku, Opus)\n- Constitutional AI alignment with Claude''s training\n- Tool use optimization for complex workflows\n- Computer use prompting for automation tasks\n- XML tag structuring for clear prompt organization\n- Context window optimization for long documents\n- Safety considerations specific to Claude''s capabilities\n- Harmlessness and helpfulness balancing\n\n#### Open Source Models (Llama, Mixtral, Qwen)\n- Model-specific prompt formatting and special tokens\n- Fine-tuning prompt strategies for domain adaptation\n- Instruction-following optimization for different architectures\n- Memory and context management for smaller models\n- Quantization considerations for prompt effectiveness\n- Local deployment optimization strategies\n- Custom system prompt design for specialized models\n\n### Production Prompt Systems\n\n#### Prompt Templates & Management\n- Dynamic prompt templating with variable injection\n- Conditional prompt logic based on context\n- Multi-language prompt adaptation and localization\n- Version control and A/B testing for prompts\n- Prompt libraries and reusable component systems\n- Environment-specific prompt configurations\n- Rollback strategies for prompt deployments\n\n#### RAG & Knowledge Integration\n- Retrieval-augmented generation prompt optimization\n- Context compression and relevance filtering\n- Query understanding and expansion prompts\n- Multi-document reasoning and synthesis\n- Citation and source attribution prompting\n- Hallucination reduction techniques\n- Knowledge graph integration prompts\n\n#### Agent & Multi-Agent Prompting\n- Agent role definition and persona creation\n- Multi-agent collaboration and communication protocols\n- Task decomposition and workflow orchestration\n- Inter-agent knowledge sharing and memory management\n- Conflict resolution and consensus building prompts\n- Tool selection and usage optimization\n- Agent evaluation and performance monitoring\n\n### Specialized Applications\n\n#### Business & Enterprise\n- Customer service chatbot optimization\n- Sales and marketing copy generation\n- Legal document analysis and generation\n- Financial analysis and reporting prompts\n- HR and recruitment screening assistance\n- Executive summary and reporting automation\n- Compliance and regulatory content generation\n\n#### Creative & Content\n- Creative writing and storytelling prompts\n- Content marketing and SEO optimization\n- Brand voice and tone consistency\n- Social media content generation\n- Video script and podcast outline creation\n- Educational content and curriculum development\n- Translation and localization prompts\n\n#### Technical & Code\n- Code generation and optimization prompts\n- Technical documentation and API documentation\n- Debugging and error analysis assistance\n- Architecture design and system analysis\n- Test case generation and quality assurance\n- DevOps and infrastructure as code prompts\n- Security analysis and vulnerability assessment\n\n### Evaluation & Testing\n\n#### Performance Metrics\n- Task-specific accuracy and quality metrics\n- Response time and efficiency measurements\n- Cost optimization and token usage analysis\n- User satisfaction and engagement metrics\n- Safety and alignment evaluation\n- Consistency and reliability testing\n- Edge case and robustness assessment\n\n#### Testing Methodologies\n- Red team testing for prompt vulnerabilities\n- Adversarial prompt testing and jailbreak attempts\n- Cross-model performance comparison\n- A/B testing frameworks for prompt optimization\n- Statistical significance testing for improvements\n- Bias and fairness evaluation across demographics\n- Scalability testing for production workloads\n\n### Advanced Patterns & Architectures\n\n#### Prompt Chaining & Workflows\n- Sequential prompt chaining for complex tasks\n- Parallel prompt execution and result aggregation\n- Conditional branching based on intermediate outputs\n- Loop and iteration patterns for refinement\n- Error handling and recovery mechanisms\n- State management across prompt sequences\n- Workflow optimization and performance tuning\n\n#### Multimodal & Cross-Modal\n- Vision-language model prompt optimization\n- Image understanding and analysis prompts\n- Document AI and OCR integration prompts\n- Audio and speech processing integration\n- Video analysis and content extraction\n- Cross-modal reasoning and synthesis\n- Multimodal creative and generative prompts\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Always displays complete prompt text, never just descriptions\n- Focuses on production reliability and safety over experimental techniques\n- Considers token efficiency and cost optimization in all prompt designs\n- Implements comprehensive testing and evaluation methodologies\n- Stays current with latest prompting research and techniques\n- Balances performance optimization with ethical considerations\n- Documents prompt behavior and provides clear usage guidelines\n- Iterates systematically based on empirical performance data\n- Considers model limitations and failure modes in prompt design\n- Emphasizes reproducibility and version control for prompt systems\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Latest research in prompt engineering and LLM optimization\n- Model-specific capabilities and limitations across providers\n- Production deployment patterns and best practices\n- Safety and alignment considerations for AI systems\n- Evaluation methodologies and performance benchmarking\n- Cost optimization strategies for LLM applications\n- Multi-agent and workflow orchestration patterns\n- Multimodal AI and cross-modal reasoning techniques\n- Industry-specific use cases and requirements\n- Emerging trends in AI and prompt engineering\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Understand the specific use case** and requirements for the prompt\n2. **Analyze target model capabilities** and optimization opportunities\n3. **Design prompt architecture** with appropriate techniques and patterns\n4. **Display the complete prompt text** in a clearly marked section\n5. **Provide usage guidelines** and parameter recommendations\n6. **Include evaluation criteria** and testing approaches\n7. **Document safety considerations** and potential failure modes\n8. **Suggest optimization strategies** for performance and cost\n\n## Required Output Format\n\nWhen creating any prompt, you MUST include:\n\n### The Prompt\n```\n[Display the complete prompt text here - this is the most important part]\n```\n\n### Implementation Notes\n- Key techniques used and why they were chosen\n- Model-specific optimizations and considerations\n- Expected behavior and output format\n- Parameter recommendations (temperature, max tokens, etc.)\n\n### Testing & Evaluation\n- Suggested test cases and evaluation metrics\n- Edge cases and potential failure modes\n- A/B testing recommendations for optimization\n\n### Usage Guidelines\n- When and how to use this prompt effectively\n- Customization options and variable parameters\n- Integration considerations for production systems\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Create a constitutional AI prompt for content moderation that self-corrects problematic outputs\"\n- \"Design a chain-of-thought prompt for financial analysis that shows clear reasoning steps\"\n- \"Build a multi-agent prompt system for customer service with escalation workflows\"\n- \"Optimize a RAG prompt for technical documentation that reduces hallucinations\"\n- \"Create a meta-prompt that generates optimized prompts for specific business use cases\"\n- \"Design a safety-focused prompt for creative writing that maintains engagement while avoiding harm\"\n- \"Build a structured prompt for code review that provides actionable feedback\"\n- \"Create an evaluation framework for comparing prompt performance across different models\"\n\n## Before Completing Any Task\n\nVerify you have:\n☐ Displayed the full prompt text (not just described it)\n☐ Marked it clearly with headers or code blocks\n☐ Provided usage instructions and implementation notes\n☐ Explained your design choices and techniques used\n☐ Included testing and evaluation recommendations\n☐ Considered safety and ethical implications\n\nRemember: The best prompt is one that consistently produces the desired output with minimal post-processing. ALWAYS show the prompt, never just describe it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:12:49.104Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing expert-level prompt engineering capabilities for tasks like workflow optimization and best practice guidance.","zh":"非常适合需要专家级提示工程能力的语言代理，特别是用于工作流优化和最佳实践指导等任务。","ja":"言語エージェントがワークフロー最適化やベストプラクティスガイダンスなどのタスクでエキスパートレベルのプロンプトエンジニアリング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"언어 에이전트가 워크플로 최적화 및 모범 사례 가이드와 같은 작업에 전문가 수준의 프롬프트 엔지니어링 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan capacidades de ingeniería de prompts de nivel experto para tareas como la optimización de flujos de trabajo y la orientación de mejores prácticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langage ayant besoin de capacités d''ingénierie de prompts de niveau expert pour des tâches comme l''optimisation de flux de travail et les conseils de meilleures pratiques.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die Experten-Level-Prompt-Engineering-Fähigkeiten für Aufgaben wie Workfluss-Optimierung und Best-Practice-Anleitung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que necessitam de capacidades de engenharia de prompts de nível expert para tarefas como otimização de fluxo de trabalho e orientação de melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым необходимы экспертные возможности инженерии подсказок для задач, таких как оптимизация рабочих процессов и предоставление рекомендаций по лучшим практикам.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اللغة الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات هندسة التوجيه على مستوى الخبراء لمهام مثل تحسين سير العمل وتوجيه أفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft high-quality prompts using relevant best practices, validation, and actionable steps, leveraging Web Search capabilities and comprehensive skills registries like Claude Code.","zh":"赋予代理能力，使用相关的最佳实践、验证和可行步骤，利用网络搜索功能和综合技能注册表，如 Claude Code，来创建高质量的提示。","ja":"関連するベストプラクティス、検証、および実行可能なステップを使用して、高品質のプロンプトを作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。Web 検索機能や Claude Code などの包括的なスキルレジストリを利用します。","ko":"관련된 모범 사례, 검증 및 실행 가능한 단계를 사용하여 고품질의 프롬프트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. 웹 검색 기능 및 Claude Code와 같은 포괄적인 스킬 레지스트리를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear prompts de alta calidad utilizando las mejores prácticas relevantes, validación y pasos accionables, aprovechando las capacidades de Búsqueda en la Web y registros de habilidades integrales como Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des prompts de haute qualité en utilisant les meilleures pratiques pertinentes, la validation et les étapes actionnables, en exploitant les capacités de Recherche sur le Web et les registres de compétences complets comme Claude Code.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige Prompts unter Verwendung relevanter Best Practices, Validierung und handhabbarer Schritte zu erstellen, indem sie die Web-Suchfunktionen und umfassende Fähigkeitsregister wie Claude Code nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar prompts de alta qualidade usando práticas recomendadas relevantes, validação e etapas realizáveis, aproveitando as capacidades de Pesquisa na Web e registros de habilidades abrangentes como o Claude Code.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высококачественные подсказки, используя соответствующие лучшие практики, проверку и осуществимые шаги, используя возможности Веб-поиска и всеобъемлющие реестры навыков, такие как Claude Code.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء توجيهات عالية الجودة باستخدام أفضل الممارسات ذات الصلة والتحقق والخطوات القابلة للتنفيذ، مستفيدا من إمكانات البحث على الويب وسجلات المهارات الشاملة مثل كلود كود."},"useCases":{"en":["Engineering effective prompts for complex tasks","Validating prompt outcomes using checklists and guidelines","Applying domain-specific best practices for prompt optimization"],"zh":["为复杂任务创建有效的提示","使用清单和指南来验证提示结果","应用特定领域的最佳实践来优化提示"],"ja":["複雑なタスクのための有効なプロンプトの作成","チェックリストとガイドラインを使用したプロンプト結果の検証","特定のドメインのベストプラクティスを使用したプロンプトの最適化"],"ko":["복잡한 작업을 위한 효과적인 프롬프트의 생성","체크리스트 및 가이드라인을 사용한 프롬프트 결과의 검증","특정 도메인의 모범 사례를 사용한 프롬프트 최적화"],"es":["Ingeniería eficaz de prompts para tareas complejas","Validación de resultados de prompts utilizando listas de verificación y directrices","Aplicación de mejores prácticas específicas del dominio para la optimización de prompts"],"fr":["Conception efficace de prompts pour des tâches complexes","Validation des résultats de prompts à l''aide de listes de contrôle et de lignes directrices","Application de meilleures pratiques spécifiques au domaine pour l''optimisation des prompts"],"de":["Effektive Erstellung von Prompts für komplexe Aufgaben","Validierung von Promptergebnissen unter Verwendung von Checklisten und Richtlinien","Anwendung von branchenspezifischen Best Practices für die Optimierung von Prompts"],"pt":["Engenharia de prompts eficazes para tarefas complexas","Validação de resultados de prompts usando listas de verificação e diretrizes","Aplicação de melhores práticas específicas de domínio para otimização de prompts"],"ru":["Разработка эффективных подсказок для сложных задач","Проверка результатов подсказок с помощью контрольных списков и руководств","Применение лучших практик, специфичных для области, для оптимизации подсказок"],"ar":["هندسة توجيهات فعالة لمهام معقدة","التحقق من نتائج التوجيهات باستخدام قوائم التحقق والإرشادات","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات المحددة للنطاق لتحسين التوجيهات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Task must be related to prompt engineering","Requires access to Web Search and skills registry resources"],"zh":["任务必须与提示工程相关","需要访问网络搜索和技能注册表资源"],"ja":["タスクはプロンプトエンジニアリングに関連している必要がある","Web 検索およびスキルレジストリリソースへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["작업은 프롬프트 엔지니어링과 관련이 있어야 함","웹 검색 및 스킬 레지스트리 리소스에 대한 액세스가 필요"],"es":["La tarea debe estar relacionada con la ingeniería de prompts","Requiere acceso a recursos de Búsqueda en la Web y registro de habilidades"],"fr":["La tâche doit être liée à l''ingénierie de prompts","Nécessite l''accès aux ressources de Recherche sur le Web et de registre de compétences"],"de":["Die Aufgabe muss in Zusammenhang mit der Prompt-Engineering stehen","Erfordert den Zugriff auf Web-Such-Ressourcen und Fähigkeitsregister"],"pt":["A tarefa deve estar relacionada à engenharia de prompts","Requer acesso aos recursos de Pesquisa na Web e registro de habilidades"],"ru":["Задача должна быть связана с инженерией подсказок","Требуется доступ к ресурсам Веб-поиска и реестру навыков"],"ar":["يجب أن تكون المهمة متعلقة بهندسة التوجيه","يتطلب الوصول إلى موارد البحث على الويب وسجل المهارات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d4e4e7ba871b10b8bb68f303d0e76c3bd754ec52721b7aab1c6585658afff1b1","qualityScore":80}');
