"支持多种PRD格式","易于使用"],"ja":["マークダウンファイルまたはテキストをprd.json形式に変換することをサポート","自動実行PRD変換","効率的な開発","多種のPRD形式をサポート","簡単な使用"],"ko":["마크다운 파일 또는 텍스트를 prd.json 형식으로 변환하는 것을 지원","자동 실행 PRD 변환","효율적인 개발","다양한 PRD 형식을 지원","쉽게 사용"],"es":["Conversión de PRD a JSON","Creación de archivos PRD en formato JSON","Ejecución autónoma de proyectos","Integración sencilla con otros herramientas","Soporte para proyectos de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Conversion de PRD en JSON","Création de fichiers PRD au format JSON","Exécution autonome de projets","Intégration simple avec d''autres outils","Prise en charge de projets de développement de logiciels"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRD in JSON","Erstellung von PRD-Dateien im JSON-Format","Autonome Ausführung von Projekten","Einfache Integration mit anderen Tools","Unterstützung von Software-Entwicklungsprojekten"],"pt":["Conversão de PRD para formato JSON","Execução autônoma de processos de desenvolvimento","Automatização de tarefas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a arquivos de PRD em formato Markdown","Geração de arquivos de PRD em formato JSON"],"ru":["Преобразование PRD в формат JSON","Автономное выполнение процессов разработки","Автоматизация задач разработки","Поддержка файлов PRD в формате Markdown","Генерация файлов PRD в формате JSON"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات PRD إلى تنسيق JSON","تشغيل ذاتي لعمليات التطوير","آليّة مهام التطوير","دعم ملفات PRD بتنسيق Markdown","توليد ملفات PRD بتنسيق JSON"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ralph PRD Converter","PRD转换工具","自动执行","高效开发","PRD格式","markdown转换","开发工具"],"ja":["Ralph PRD Converter","PRD変換ツール","自動実行","効率的な開発","PRD形式","マークダウン変換","開発ツール"],"ko":["Ralph PRD Converter","PRD 변환 도구","자동 실행","효율적인 개발","PRD 형식","마크다운 변환","개발 도구"],"es":["Ralph","Conversor de PRD","JSON","Ejecución autónoma","Desarrollo de software","Integración de herramientas","PRD a JSON","Automatización de proyectos"],"fr":["Ralph","Convertisseur de PRD","JSON","Exécution autonome","Développement de logiciels","Intégration d''outils","PRD en JSON","Automatisation de projets"],"de":["Ralph","PRD-Converter","JSON","Autonome Ausführung","Software-Entwicklung","Integration von Tools","PRD in JSON","Automatisierung von Projekten"],"pt":["Ralph PRD Converter","Conversão de PRD","Formato JSON","Execução autônoma","Desenvolvimento de software","Automatização de processos"],"ru":["Ralph PRD Конвертер","Преобразование PRD","Формат JSON","Автономное выполнение","Разработка программного обеспечения","Автоматизация процессов"],"ar":["مُحول رالف PRD","تحويل PRD","تنسيق JSON","تشغيل ذاتي","تطوير البرمجيات","آليّة العمليات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph","description":"Convert PRDs to prd.json format for the Ralph autonomous agent system. Use when you have an existing PRD and need to convert it to Ralphs JSON format. Triggers on: convert this prd, turn this into ralph format, create prd.json from this, ralph json.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph PRD Converter\n\nConverts existing PRDs to the prd.json format that Ralph uses for autonomous execution.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\nTake a PRD (markdown file or text) and convert it to `prd.json` in your ralph directory.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"[Project Name]\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/[feature-name-kebab-case]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Feature description from PRD title/intro]\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"[Story title]\",\n      \"description\": \"As","body":"# Ralph PRD Converter\n\nConverts existing PRDs to the prd.json format that Ralph uses for autonomous execution.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\nTake a PRD (markdown file or text) and convert it to `prd.json` in your ralph directory.\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"[Project Name]\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/[feature-name-kebab-case]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Feature description from PRD title/intro]\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"[Story title]\",\n      \"description\": \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Criterion 1\",\n        \"Criterion 2\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Story Size: The Number One Rule\n\n**Each story must be completable in ONE Ralph iteration (one context window).**\n\nRalph spawns a fresh Amp instance per iteration with no memory of previous work. If a story is too big, the LLM runs out of context before finishing and produces broken code.\n\n### Right-sized stories:\n- Add a database column and migration\n- Add a UI component to an existing page\n- Update a server action with new logic\n- Add a filter dropdown to a list\n\n### Too big (split these):\n- \"Build the entire dashboard\" - Split into: schema, queries, UI components, filters\n- \"Add authentication\" - Split into: schema, middleware, login UI, session handling\n- \"Refactor the API\" - Split into one story per endpoint or pattern\n\n**Rule of thumb:** If you cannot describe the change in 2-3 sentences, it is too big.\n\n---\n\n## Story Ordering: Dependencies First\n\nStories execute in priority order. Earlier stories must not depend on later ones.\n\n**Correct order:**\n1. Schema/database changes (migrations)\n2. Server actions / backend logic\n3. UI components that use the backend\n4. Dashboard/summary views that aggregate data\n\n**Wrong order:**\n1. UI component (depends on schema that does not exist yet)\n2. Schema change\n\n---\n\n## Acceptance Criteria: Must Be Verifiable\n\nEach criterion must be something Ralph can CHECK, not something vague.\n\n### Good criteria (verifiable):\n- \"Add `status` column to tasks table with default ''pending''\"\n- \"Filter dropdown has options: All, Active, Completed\"\n- \"Clicking delete shows confirmation dialog\"\n- \"Typecheck passes\"\n- \"Tests pass\"\n\n### Bad criteria (vague):\n- \"Works correctly\"\n- \"User can do X easily\"\n- \"Good UX\"\n- \"Handles edge cases\"\n\n### Always include as final criterion:\n```\n\"Typecheck passes\"\n```\n\nFor stories with testable logic, also include:\n```\n\"Tests pass\"\n```\n\n### For stories that change UI, also include:\n```\n\"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n```\n\nFrontend stories are NOT complete until visually verified. Ralph will use the dev-browser skill to navigate to the page, interact with the UI, and confirm changes work.\n\n---\n\n## Conversion Rules\n\n1. **Each user story becomes one JSON entry**\n2. **IDs**: Sequential (US-001, US-002, etc.)\n3. **Priority**: Based on dependency order, then document order\n4. **All stories**: `passes: false` and empty `notes`\n5. **branchName**: Derive from feature name, kebab-case, prefixed with `ralph/`\n6. **Always add**: \"Typecheck passes\" to every story''s acceptance criteria\n\n---\n\n## Splitting Large PRDs\n\nIf a PRD has big features, split them:\n\n**Original:**\n> \"Add user notification system\"\n\n**Split into:**\n1. US-001: Add notifications table to database\n2. US-002: Create notification service for sending notifications\n3. US-003: Add notification bell icon to header\n4. US-004: Create notification dropdown panel\n5. US-005: Add mark-as-read functionality\n6. US-006: Add notification preferences page\n\nEach is one focused change that can be completed and verified independently.\n\n---\n\n## Example\n\n**Input PRD:**\n```markdown\n# Task Status Feature\n\nAdd ability to mark tasks with different statuses.\n\n## Requirements\n- Toggle between pending/in-progress/done on task list\n- Filter list by status\n- Show status badge on each task\n- Persist status in database\n```\n\n**Output prd.json:**\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"TaskApp\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/task-status\",\n  \"description\": \"Task Status Feature - Track task progress with status indicators\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Add status field to tasks table\",\n      \"description\": \"As a developer, I need to store task status in the database.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Add status column: ''pending'' | ''in_progress'' | ''done'' (default ''pending'')\",\n        \"Generate and run migration successfully\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Display status badge on task cards\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to see task status at a glance.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each task card shows colored status badge\",\n        \"Badge colors: gray=pending, blue=in_progress, green=done\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 2,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Add status toggle to task list rows\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to change task status directly from the list.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each row has status dropdown or toggle\",\n        \"Changing status saves immediately\",\n        \"UI updates without page refresh\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 3,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-004\",\n      \"title\": \"Filter tasks by status\",\n      \"description\": \"As a user, I want to filter the list to see only certain statuses.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Filter dropdown: All | Pending | In Progress | Done\",\n        \"Filter persists in URL params\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 4,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Archiving Previous Runs\n\n**Before writing a new prd.json, check if there is an existing one from a different feature:**\n\n1. Read the current `prd.json` if it exists\n2. Check if `branchName` differs from the new feature''s branch name\n3. If different AND `progress.txt` has content beyond the header:\n   - Create archive folder: `archive/YYYY-MM-DD-feature-name/`\n   - Copy current `prd.json` and `progress.txt` to archive\n   - Reset `progress.txt` with fresh header\n\n**The ralph.sh script handles this automatically** when you run it, but if you are manually updating prd.json between runs, archive first.\n\n---\n\n## Checklist Before Saving\n\nBefore writing prd.json, verify:\n\n- [ ] **Previous run archived** (if prd.json exists with different branchName, archive it first!)\n- [ ] **ALL stories have `passes: false`** (CRITICAL - never copy old pass status!)\n- [ ] Each story is completable in one iteration (small enough)\n- [ ] Stories are ordered by dependency (schema to backend to UI)\n- [ ] Every story has \"Typecheck passes\" as criterion\n- [ ] UI stories have \"Verify in browser\" as criterion\n- [ ] Acceptance criteria are verifiable (not vague)\n- [ ] No story depends on a later story\n\n## CRITICAL: Always Reset passes to false\n\nWhen creating a new prd.json, **ALWAYS** set `passes: false` for every story. Never:\n- Copy pass status from an old prd.json\n- Leave stories marked as `passes: true`\n- Assume previous work carries over\n\nEach new prd.json is a fresh start. The Ralph loop will mark stories as `passes: true` only after successfully implementing them.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:13:35.421Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Execution Agents needing PRD conversion to JSON format.","zh":"适合需要将 PRD 转换为 JSON 格式的自主执行代理。","ja":"PRD を JSON フォーマットに変換する必要がある自律実行エージェントに最適です。","ko":"PRD를 JSON 형식으로 변환해야 하는 자율 실행 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Ejecución Autónoma que necesitan conversión de PRD a formato JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Exécution Autonome ayant besoin de conversion de PRD au format JSON.","de":"Perfekt für autonome Ausführungsagenten, die eine PRD-Konvertierung im JSON-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Execução Autônoma que precisam de conversão de PRD para formato JSON.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов выполнения, которым требуется преобразование PRD в формат JSON.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تنفيذ خودي تتطلب تحويل PRD إلى تنسيق JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert existing PRDs to prd.json format, utilizing markdown files or text, and outputting JSON with project, branchName, description, and userStories, enabling seamless autonomous execution with Ralph.","zh":"使代理能够将现有的 PRD 转换为 prd.json 格式，利用 markdown 文件或文本，并输出包含项目、分支名称、描述和用户故事的 JSON，从而实现与 Ralph 的无缝自主执行。","ja":"エージェントが既存の PRD を prd.json フォーマットに変換できるようにし、Markdown ファイルまたはテキストを利用して、プロジェクト、ブランチ名、説明、およびユーザー ストーリーを含む JSON を出力し、Ralph とのシームレスな自律実行を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 기존 PRD를 prd.json 형식으로 변환할 수 있도록 하여 마크다운 파일 또는 텍스트를 사용하여 프로젝트, 분기 이름, 설명 및 사용자 스토리를 포함하는 JSON을 출력하고, 랄프(Ralph)와의无缝 자율 실행을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir los PRD existentes al formato prd.json, utilizando archivos markdown o texto, y generando JSON con proyecto, nombre de rama, descripción y historias de usuario, lo que permite una ejecución autónoma fluida con Ralph.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir les PRD existants au format prd.json, en utilisant des fichiers markdown ou du texte, et en générant du JSON avec projet, nom de branche, description et histoires utilisateur, ce qui permet une exécution autonome fluide avec Ralph.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, bestehende PRD in das prd.json-Format zu konvertieren, indem sie Markdown-Dateien oder Text verwenden und JSON mit Projekt, Branch-Name, Beschreibung und Benutzerstories ausgeben, was eine nahtlose autonome Ausführung mit Ralph ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter PRDs existentes para o formato prd.json, utilizando arquivos markdown ou texto, e produzindo JSON com projeto, nome da branch, descrição e histórias de usuário, permitindo uma execução autônoma sem interrupções com Ralph.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать существующие PRD в формат prd.json, используя файлы markdown или текст, и выводить JSON с проектом, именем ветки, описанием и историями пользователей, обеспечивая бесперебойное автономное выполнение с Ralph.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحويل PRDs الحالية إلى تنسيق prd.json، باستخدام ملفات markdown أو نص، وإخراج JSON مع المشروع واسم الفرع والوصف وقصص المستخدم، مما يتيح التنفيذ الذاتي المتواصل مع Ralph."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting PRDs for autonomous project execution","Generating prd.json files for Ralph directory","Parsing markdown files for feature description extraction"],"zh":["将 PRD 转换为自主项目执行","为 Ralph 目录生成 prd.json 文件","解析 markdown 文件以提取功能描述"],"ja":["自律プロジェクト実行のための PRD を変換する","Ralph ディレクトリ用の prd.json ファイルを生成する","機能説明の抽出のための Markdown ファイルを解析する"],"ko":["자율 프로젝트 실행을 위한 PRD 변환","Ralph 디렉토리용 prd.json 파일 생성","기능 설명 추출을 위한 마크다운 파일 파싱"],"es":["Conversión de PRD para la ejecución autónoma de proyectos","Generación de archivos prd.json para el directorio de Ralph","Análisis de archivos markdown para la extracción de descripciones de funciones"],"fr":["Conversion de PRD pour l''exécution autonome de projets","Génération de fichiers prd.json pour le répertoire de Ralph","Analyse de fichiers markdown pour l''extraction de descriptions de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRD für die autonome Ausführung von Projekten","Erzeugung von prd.json-Dateien für das Verzeichnis von Ralph","Analyse von Markdown-Dateien zur Extraktion von Funktionsbeschreibungen"],"pt":["Conversão de PRDs para execução de projetos autônoma","Geração de arquivos prd.json para diretório Ralph","Análise de arquivos markdown para extração de descrições de recursos"],"ru":["Преобразование PRD для автономного выполнения проектов","Генерация файлов prd.json для каталога Ralph","Парсинг файлов markdown для извлечения описаний функций"],"ar":["تحويل PRDs لتنفيذ مشاريع ذاتي","توليد ملفات prd.json لمديرية Ralph","تحليل ملفات markdown لاستخراج وصفات الميزات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires input PRD in markdown file or text format","Output limited to prd.json format"],"zh":["需要输入 PRD 为 markdown 文件或文本格式","输出仅限于 prd.json 格式"],"ja":["入力 PRD は Markdown ファイルまたはテキスト形式である必要がある","出力は prd.json フォーマットのみに限られる"],"ko":["입력 PRD는 마크다운 파일 또는 텍스트 형식으로 필요","출력은 prd.json 형식으로만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere PRD de entrada en formato de archivo markdown o texto","Salida limitada al formato prd.json"],"fr":["Nécessite une PRD d''entrée au format de fichier markdown ou texte","Sortie limitée au format prd.json"],"de":["Benötigt Eingabe-PRD im Markdown-Datei- oder Textformat","Ausgabe beschränkt auf das prd.json-Format"],"pt":["Requer entrada de PRD em formato de arquivo markdown ou texto","Saída limitada ao formato prd.json"],"ru":["Требует ввода PRD в формате файла markdown или текста","Выход ограничен форматом prd.json"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال PRD في تنسيق ملف markdown أو نص","الإخراج محدود بتنسيق prd.json"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a6a8733abaee5b370957ebd6745a56db88712697fc1262f388d2438b6bbcc021","qualityScore":80}');
